[11:34:50.515] CORE EXPERIMENT - C objects -> virtual addresses (README 九)
[11:34:50.515] ======================================================================
[11:34:50.515] PIE + ASLR randomize ABSOLUTE addresses, but the relative layout
[11:34:50.515] (text/rodata/data/bss < heap < mmap < stack) is preserved.
